<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl w-full bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-white/20">
    
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-wider text-white mb-2" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Your Data is Yours.</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-8" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">No ads. No selling. No "Big Brother."</p>
    
    <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6">
      <p class="italic text-slate-500 text-sm" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Last Updated: January 29, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Our Promise</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        We built Memflect because we needed a safe space for our own thoughts. We believe your memories and voice are sacred. 
        Unlike "Big Tech" platforms, <strong>we do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data</strong> for ad revenue. You are the customer, not the product.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">What Data We Collect</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        <strong>Email Address</strong> - Required to create your account and send you your reflection audio.<br><br>
        <strong>Voice Recording</strong> - The 10-second memory you record to create your reflection.<br><br>
        <strong>Payment Information</strong> - Processed securely by Stripe (we never see your full card number).<br><br>
        <strong>Usage Data</strong> - Basic analytics like which soundscapes you choose and when you create reflections (used to improve the product).<br><br>
        We do NOT collect: browsing history across other sites, contacts, photos, location data, or any data unrelated to creating your reflections.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Your Voice & Reflections</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        We collect your voice recordings solely to generate your personal reflection audio. 
        We do not use your private voice data to train public AI models that mimic human speech. 
        Your voice stays within your private reflection loop.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Third-Party Services We Use</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        To provide Memflect's core features, we work with trusted service providers:<br><br>
        <strong>ElevenLabs</strong> - Voice cloning technology. Your voice recording is sent to ElevenLabs to create your AI voice clone. ElevenLabs processes audio according to their privacy policy and does not use your voice for model training.<br><br>
        <strong>OpenAI (GPT-4)</strong> - Generates your reflection script based on your memory. We send your text input (not your voice) to OpenAI to create personalized narratives. OpenAI does not use your data to train their models.<br><br>
        <strong>Stripe</strong> - Payment processing. When you purchase the extended version, Stripe securely handles your payment. We never see or store your full credit card details. Stripe's privacy policy governs payment data.<br><br>
        <strong>AWS S3</strong> - File storage. Your audio files are stored encrypted on Amazon Web Services servers. AWS provides enterprise-grade security and encryption.<br><br>
        <strong>Postmark</strong> - Transactional emails. We use Postmark to send you purchase confirmations and magic login links. Your email is only used for account-related messages, never marketing.<br><br>
        All service providers are contractually required to protect your data and may not use it for their own purposes.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Private by Default</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        Your recordings are encrypted in storage. We have designed the system so that your reflections are yours alone. 
        If you delete a memory, it is gone from our servers forever.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Your Rights</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        You have the right to:<br><br>
        • Access your data (view what we have)<br>
        • Delete your account and all associated data<br>
        • Export your reflections<br>
        • Opt out of analytics cookies<br><br>
        To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:ryan@memflect.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">ryan@memflect.com</a>
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-white mt-6" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">Talk to a Human</h2>
      <p style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">
        Memflect is built by a real person, not a faceless corporation. If you have concerns, email me directly: 
        <a href="mailto:ryan@memflect.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline" style="font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;">ryan@memflect.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
      <%= link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "text-sky-400 hover:underline", style: "font-family: sans-serif !important; text-transform: none !important;" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>